TI  - Efficacy and safety of lumacaftor and ivacaftor in patients aged 6-11 years with 
      cystic fibrosis homozygous for F508del-CFTR: a randomised, placebo-controlled 
      phase 3 trial.
PG  - 557-567
LID - S2213-2600(17)30215-1 [pii]
LID - 10.1016/S2213-2600(17)30215-1 [doi]
AB  - BACKGROUND: Lumacaftor and ivacaftor combination therapy has been approved for 
      patients aged 12 years and older with cystic fibrosis homozygous for F508del-CFTR. 
      METHODS: In this phase 3, multicentre, randomised, double-blind, 
      placebo-controlled trial, children aged 6-11 years were randomly assigned. 
      INTERPRETATION: Lumacaftor and ivacaftor improved lung clearance index. FUNDING: 
      Vertex Pharmaceuticals Incorporated.
